## Troubleshooting
| Symptom | Cause | Fix |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Crash on launch | Native module ABI mismatch | Run `{{CLEAN_CMD}}` then reinstall pods/gradle |
| Install fails | Lockfile drift | Delete lockfile + node_modules, reinstall |
| Build slow / stale | Stale caches | `{{CACHE_CLEAR_CMD}}` |

